{
  "title": "Zesty Spring Russian Vegetable Stew",
  "description": "A floral and springy Russian dish featuring caraway seed, this ovo-vegetarian-friendly stew is perfect for a weeknight dinner. It is cooked in a hot pot vessel using the nimono simmer method.",
